      "statement": "ulabase.setup.consents.ts imports the accounts setup and runs the gate steps in order: accounts steps (minus appPointsAtService), the userConsentsSchema schema step, the users collection jsonSchema binding (PATCH /users checked via /users/_meta), the userCanPatchOwnConsents permission with bson-request-whitelist(consents) and mergeRequest, the account-properties-claims step adding latestConsents/tos and latestConsents/pp, the guards feature install, and the consentsGate rule with status_code 451 and on_error allow, followed last by appPointsAtService.",
