      "statement": "TOS_VERSION and PP_VERSION in ulabase.setup.consents.ts are the single source: the permission's mergeRequest and the guard condition are both derived from the accepted object, so publishing new terms is editing two strings and re-running the setup; the remaining manual places are the 'Version 2026-07-01' lines in public/terms.html and public/privacy.html.",
